OL,3,ABurnham tells MPs a new EU deal could
OL,4,Aboost growth and help tackle illegal
OL,5,Aimmigration
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham tells MPs it would be a
OL,8,F"dereliction of duty" to turn down a
OL,9,Fcloser relationship with the EU - and
OL,10,Fnew deals could boost growth and tackle
OL,11,Fillegal immigration
OL,13,FIn a statement in Parliament, he says
OL,14,FBritain should set up a "serious
OL,15,Fdialogue" about the future of the EU
OL,16,Frelationship, and at every stage the
OL,17,FBritish public "will be the boss"
OL,19,FThe PM told the BBC two weeks ago it
OL,20,Fwas "possible" a future Labour
OL,21,Fmanifesto could promise a new
OL,22,Freferendum
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
