OL,3,ASaudi minister vows 'serious response'
OL,4,Ato Houthi attacks on airports
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Sunday, a Pakistani man was killed
OL,7,Fin an attack on a terminal at the
OL,8,Fcapital's King Khalid International
OL,9,FAirport, Saudi authorities said. It
OL,10,Fcame a day after a Houthi missile hit
OL,11,Fanother terminal, killing 13 people and
OL,12,Fforcing its closure.
OL,14,FThe Houthis said they launched the
OL,15,Fattacks in retaliation for "brutal
OL,16,FSaudi aggression" against areas they
OL,17,Fcontrol in western Yemen.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
